classDiagram
 direction LR
class ShareGrant {
  <<AggregateRoot>>
  -UUID id
  -UUID reportId
  -UUID sessionId
  -Long ownerId
  -String tokenHash
  -String scope
  -Instant expiresAt
  -Instant revokedAt
  +isAccessible(Instant now, boolean deleted) boolean
  +revoke(Instant now) void
}
class DeletionRequest {
  <<AggregateRoot>>
  -UUID id
  -UUID sessionId
  -Long ownerId
  -DeletionState state
  -Set~String~ expectedContexts
  -Instant deadline
  +registerReceipt(PurgeReceipt receipt) void
  +isComplete() boolean
}
class DeletionState {
  <<enumeration>>
  REQUESTED
  ACCESS_BLOCKED
  PURGING
  COMPLETED
  RETRY_REQUIRED
}
class PurgeReceipt {
  <<Entity>>
  -UUID id
  -String context
  -Instant completedAt
}
DeletionRequest "1" *-- "0..*" PurgeReceipt : confirmaciones
DeletionRequest --> DeletionState : estado
ShareGrant ..> DeletionRequest : bloquea acceso por sesión
